	its gaps with zero blocks left as gaps.
	(copy_zeros, all_zero, tail_zero, spool, copy_slow): New
	functions.
	(spool_open): New function.  Block signals while the spool file
	has a name.  Warn when the name cannot be removed.
	(tmpl_close): Leave standard input just past the copied content
	when the copy read it by offset.
	(read_all): Remove.
	(write_buf, write_at, fill_range, io_bufsize, io_bufalloc): Move
	to io.c.
	* src/fastio.c: Include each header only where the code using it
	is built.
	(fast_copy): Clamp each request to SSIZE_MAX.  Fall back to
	sendfile where copy_file_range refuses.
	(fast_tmpfile, fast_link, fast_writeback, fast_spool, fast_splice)
